                <pb facs="0407" n="283" sameAs="frus:frus1921v01/pg283"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">824.002/52: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Bolivia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Maginnis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">La
                                Paz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-02-01T14:00:00-04:32"><hi rendition="#italic">February 1,
                                1921—2 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 11 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>15. …</p>
                <p>Your 20 [<hi rendition="#italic">5</hi>], January 31st. Situation tranquil and
                    unless something unforeseen occurs, would recommend that recognition should be
                    extended next week after carnival.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Maginnis</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
